sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant E as Editor (client)
  participant T as tRPC workflows.execute
  participant I as Inngest
  participant F as executeWorkflow
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant R as Executor registry
  participant X as External API
  participant RT as Inngest Realtime

  U->>E: Click "Execute workflow"
  E->>T: mutate({ id })
  T->>DB: Verify workflow ownership
  T->>I: send workflows/execute.workflow
  I->>F: Run function (retries 0 dev / 3 prod)
  F->>DB: create Execution (RUNNING)
  F->>DB: Load workflow nodes + connections
  F->>F: topologicalSort(nodes, connections)
  loop Each node in order
    F->>R: getExecutor(node.type)
    R->>RT: publish status "loading"
    R->>X: Call AI / Telegram / Sheets / HTTP
    X-->>R: Result
    R->>RT: publish status "success" or "error"
    R-->>F: Merge result into WorkflowContext
  end
  F->>DB: update Execution (SUCCESS, output, completedAt)
  alt Any unhandled error
    F->>DB: onFailure → Execution (FAILED, errorStack)
  end
  U->>RT: Subscribe with realtime token
  RT-->>U: node status updates
